&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Burson France is seeking an accomplished and visionary &lt;strong&gt;Head of Technology Practice &lt;/strong&gt;to lead and grow our dynamic technology portfolio. This pivotal leadership role is responsible for driving the strategic direction, growth, and operational excellence of Burson&#39;s Technology practice across France. Reporting directly to the CEO/Managing Director of Burson France, you will be critical in identifying and securing new business opportunities, ensuring high-quality client delivery, fostering team development, and championing innovation within the Burson brand. You will play a key role in protecting and promoting Burson&#39;s distinct approach to technology communications, directly contributing to the practice&#39;s revenue targets and elevating our reputation as a market leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic growth and business development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive technology revenue growth across France, identifying, securing, and expanding high-value client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead market-facing new business development, proactively originating opportunities, opening doors with net-new clients, and personally leading major pitches and conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Burson’s technology proposition in France, expanding our footprint with existing clients, scaling multi-market engagements, and integrating broader Burson capabilities to deliver greater client value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client leadership and financial management:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted senior advisor to France&#39;s most influential technology clients, providing strategic counsel to C-suite and senior stakeholders on complex communication challenges and program implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for overall profitability, quality, relationship management, and client satisfaction for all technology accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage practice finances, including budget development, management, resourcing, and forecasting for the technology practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team leadership and talent development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and inspire a high-performing Technology team in France, creating a culture of collaboration, inclusion, and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the right capabilities are in place to support growth, providing mentorship, identifying development gaps, and implementing training initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thought leadership and innovation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation and modern delivery, embedding emerging technologies, AI-enabled solutions, and new IP into client offerings to enhance impact, efficiency, and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess an excellent understanding of the evolving media landscape and demonstrate the ability to collaborate effectively with multiple internal stakeholders, including Burson’s regional and global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of building, growing, and leading a technology practice or significant technology portfolio in France (or a similar mature European market), ideally within a communications, consulting, or professional services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior client advisory gravitas, with the ability to counsel, influence, and build trust with C-suite and senior government or enterprise stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable success in new business origination and growth, with experience winning complex, high-value mandates in competitive and fast-evolving markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the French business and cultural landscape, with the credibility and networks to operate effectively across diverse markets and client environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal communication skills and proven people leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise and curiosity within the technology sector, with a clear view of emerging trends, innovation, and disruption shaping client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level fluency in French (written and spoken) and professional fluency in English (written and spoken) is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Burson: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LIAB1,20&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt; At PHENOGY, we energize the future—sustainably. In this role&amp;nbsp;you will define and execute our digital engineering strategy, owning the architecture, security, quality, and lifecycle of our cloud, edge, and data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating at the intersection of clean energy and industrial IoT, you will lead the digital ecosystem for our Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;148&quot;&gt;from the gateway upward&lt;/strong&gt;—connecting Edge/Gateway → Cloud Infrastructure → APIs → Monitoring/NOC → Customer Applications &amp;amp; Data Platforms. Working in close alignment with our Embedded Systems lead, Product, Cybersecurity, Operations, and Quality teams, you will turn complex energy and regulatory requirements into scalable, high-availability software and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Will Own &amp;amp; Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Data Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define our technology roadmap, sourcing model (in-house vs. external), and application/data architecture. Establish clear boundaries, data models, APIs, and technical standards from the gateway layer through edge computing, cloud services, data pipelines, and customer/Battery Passport platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering, DevOps &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal engineers and external partners. Govern the full software lifecycle—from requirements and Git workflows to automated CI/CD pipelines, environment segregation, release/rollback procedures, and end-of-life decommissioning. Champion automated testing (unit, integration, performance, regression) and proactively manage technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Cybersecurity &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed Security-by-Design via a Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC). Oversee secure coding, secrets/certificate management, SBOMs, open-source licensing, vulnerability remediation (SAST/DAST/SCA), and penetration testing across our edge and cloud stack in alignment with ISO/IEC 27001, IEC 62443, NIST SSDF, OWASP, NIS2, and the EU Cyber Resilience Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connected Fleet &amp;amp; Data Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive high-throughput telemetry ingestion, operational data processing, analytics, remote diagnostics, gateway/edge over-the-air (OTA) updates, and secure remote access across our connected storage fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Embedded Interface Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Embedded Systems lead (who owns BMS, controllers, and string-level firmware) to define clean gateway protocols and data contracts—ensuring seamless integration without overlapping responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; Supplier Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing platform and data engineering organization. Manage external development partners from technical due diligence and contracting through delivery, ensuring clean IP ownership, documentation, and zero single-vendor lock-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Executive Governance &amp;amp; IT Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold decision-making authority over digital platform architecture, tech stacks, repositories, CI/CD, and technical debt. Partner closely with the Head of IT to maintain a clear boundary between product software and enterprise IT while jointly governing shared domains (IAM, cloud infrastructure, networking, incident response, and disaster recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Engineering, IT, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record leading software/data teams, complex engineering programs, and external development vendors, translating business goals into clear roadmaps and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud, API &amp;amp; Data Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in cloud-native software architecture, data pipelines/telemetry processing, integration patterns, REST/streaming APIs, DevOps, CI/CD automation, and full-lifecycle release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of secure software engineering practices, vulnerability management, and risk-based decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge deep technical execution with executive stakeholder alignment—balancing speed, cost, quality, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Domain experience in Energy Tech, BESS, Industrial IoT, Edge computing, or connected fleet platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Microsoft Azure, Azure DevOps, C#/.NET, Python, modern data stacks, and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443 and cybersecurity standards for connected industrial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience managing high-availability operational systems and formal product lifecycle management (PLM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How Success Is Measured&lt;/strong&gt; You will have clear ownership backed by transparent engineering metrics, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Roadmap predictability, release frequency, deployment success/rollback rates, platform availability, and incident trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Code, Data &amp;amp; Security Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Automated test coverage, data pipeline reliability/latency, CI/CD maturity, defect rates/MTTR, critical vulnerability remediation speed, and technical debt reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture documentation completeness, supplier delivery quality, and R&amp;amp;D resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workload:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time | &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Management / Head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive Management (CTO / COO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is building its Core Enterprise business in the DACH region, and we are hiring a Regional Sales Director to lead it. This is a build role in a new market: you will create the pipeline machine from the ground up, rather than inherit an established team or playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a team of six Enterprise Account Executives. The team sells deals of €100K–€300K AOV over four to six month cycles, so the role calls for pace and velocity paired with value-based selling rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote, and you can be based anywhere in Germany. Munich, Düsseldorf and Cologne are our key hub cities for the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the performance, development and day-to-day leadership of a team of six Enterprise Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a pipeline machine in a new market: define the target accounts, segments and motions that generate repeatable new business across Germany, Austria and Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and embed a team playbook covering prospecting, qualification, deal progression and handover, so the team sells consistently and new hires ramp quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team through each deal cycle, driving execution and velocity and embedding MEDDIC and Command of the Message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressure-test deal qualification, challenge assumptions, and help your team navigate the complexity of selling into large DACH enterprises. This isn&#39;t a role where you sit above the deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the commercial muscles (cross-sell, multi-product attach, stakeholder mapping) that will drive durable growth as we expand our footprint across the region&#39;s largest accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a structured operating rhythm of pipeline reviews, deal inspection and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate ADRs, Marketing, Solutions Engineering and partners around your team&#39;s priorities, influencing functions you do not directly own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged and high-performing team, developing AEs into strong Core Enterprise sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with your peer Regional Sales Directors, Samsara&#39;s wider leadership and Customer Success to ensure your team has the support it needs to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model and embed Samsara&#39;s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and into new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Three or more years of proven success leading new business sales at enterprise level, with a track record of revenue delivery and overachievement against target&lt;/li&gt;
